  "cfgBinaryHelp": "Local executable to analyze directly (not a container image) — e.g. a statically linked Go binary.\nForces the syft backend: the only one able to read the metadata embedded in a binary (Go buildinfo via go-module-binary-cataloger; syft generic classifier for a few well-known libraries — OpenSSL, zlib, sqlite…).\nDoes not recover statically linked dependencies without embedded metadata (home-made C/C++, Rust without cargo-auditable).",
