  "cfgDepthLabel": "Depth (--depth)",
  "cfgDepthHelp": "Descends into the objects contained in the input: for example the jars of an RPM, the packages or archives of a tar.gz, the jars of a fat jar.\n• 0: the object only (default)\n• N: N levels (1 = direct objects, 2 = what they contain…)\n• Unlimited: all levels (capped at 10)\nManifests found (package-lock.json, go.sum, pom.xml…) are analyzed. The global SBOM merges all components (location/depth properties, parent → child dependencies). Extraction is size-bounded.",
